the Sonic Discumbobulator~
You see before you a large, black ring.  It has many strange symbols carved
all the way around the outside of edge of it.  Placed on it's edge, it stands
approximately 4 feet tall, with the circular thickness of the ring being
about 4 inches.  This device is what breaks down the molecular structure of
the creature being launched so that it is capable of portalling.

~
