inhibitor backlash~
What you see is nothing more than a thin, clear disc.  It is about 6 inches
in diameter and perhaps a quarter of an inch thick.  It's function is to
prevent any kind of return energy spikes from travelling back through the
portal and zapping the sender.  You don't think the immortal controlling the
launch wants those mobiles running around them, do you?

~
